          "Title": "curl: IMAP APPEND plus CRLF conversion command injection",
          "Description": "Enabling `CURLOPT_CRLF` causes curl to advertise the raw input byte count in\nthe `IMAP APPEND {N}` literal while transmitting line-ending expanded data.\nThe server reads only $N$ bytes for the payload, causing the remaining\noverflow bytes to be interpreted and executed as pipelined IMAP commands\nwithin the authenticated session.",
