          "Title": "curl: curl: wolfSSL public-key pinning bypass",
          "Description": "When built with wolfSSL, curl can successfully validate a pinned public key\nhash against a key the TLS peer does not possess. During the TLS handshake,\nwolfSSL validates the connection, but curl's subsequent re-parsing of the same\ncertificate - tricked by a manipulated validity length field - extracts and\nmatches a different embedded key, incorrectly authorizing the pinned public\nkey.",
