          "Fingerprint": "sha256:08406f8a746974fafe06cf5de1789f3caf36363c097edd259be02997b86a9236",
          "Title": "binutils: GNU Binutils: Denial of Service via null pointer dereference",
          "Description": "A vulnerability was detected in GNU Binutils 2.47. Affected by this vulnerability is the function elf_x86_allocate_dynrelocs of the file bfd/elfxx-x86.c of the component Dynamic Relocation Allocation. The manipulation results in null pointer dereference. The attack requires a local approach. The exploit is now public and may be used. Upgrading to version 2.48 addresses this issue. The patch is identified as d1268210b6f6/471130b39c0/283d3198bed/0a84e560216/a692a633d40. Upgrading the affected component is recommended.",
